# Two guests throw into one pile on one tick: some of their takes lose while their claims wait,
# so a bound no hand-back can meet must fail.
scenario mf_lost_take
scene pile60_four
seed 71
guests 2
end 6s
light_mass 20kg
authority interaction

net g1 rtt 100ms jitter 20ms loss 2%
net g2 rtt 100ms jitter 20ms loss 2%

p1 grab ball_s as a1
p2 grab ball_n as a2
at 1200ms p1 throw 2 0.3 -0.1 speed 8 as t1
at 1200ms p2 throw 2 0.3 0.1 speed 8 as t2

expect lost_takes.max <= 0.001m
